    "title": "Levittown Man Pleads Guilty for October 2025 DWI Crash that Killed Motorcyclist - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chris Boyle ,\n12 hours ago Nassau County District Attorney Anne T. Donnelly announced that a Levittown man pleaded guilty today to aggravated vehicular homicide and other charges for an October 2025 DWI crash on North Jerusalem Avenue in North Bellmore that killed a 63-year-old motorcyclist. Patrick Thompson, 59, pleaded guilty today before Judge Robert Bogle... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
